---
---
<section class="chat" id="chat" aria-label="对话">
  <div class="chat-head">
    <div class="who"><span class="dot"></span>小鲸 · 在线</div>
    <button class="chev" id="btn-chev" type="button" title="收起消息区">▾</button>
  </div>
  <div class="msgs" id="msgs">
    <div class="msg bot">
      <div class="name">小鲸 · 演示</div>
      <div class="bubble">今天也辛苦了。要不要先靠一会儿？</div>
    </div>
    <div class="msg me">
      <div class="name">你</div>
      <div class="bubble">今天好累，想睡觉。</div>
    </div>
    <div class="msg bot">
      <div class="name">小鲸 · 演示</div>
      <div class="bubble">那就把灯调暗一点，我陪你眯一会儿。<div class="typing" style="margin-top:6px"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div></div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="composer">
    <div class="attach">＋</div>
    <div class="input">
      <span class="hint">和它说点什么…<span class="kbd">　Enter 发送 · Shift+Enter 换行</span></span>
    </div>
    <div class="send">↑</div>
  </div>
</section>
